001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.          TRSHIFT.
001300 AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
001400 DATE-WRITTEN.        7/1/83.
001500 DATE-COMPILED.
001600*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
001700*SECURITY.
001800*REMARKS.  THIS PROGRAM RIGHT SHIFTS AND ZERO-FILLS ANY FIELD UP
001900*          TO 8 BYTES LONG.
002000*
002100 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002200 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002300 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002400 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
002500
002600 DATA DIVISION.
002700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002800
002900 77  SUB2                 PIC 9(2)  VALUE ZERO.
003000 77  SUB3                 PIC 9(2)  VALUE ZERO.
003100
003200 LINKAGE SECTION.
003300 01  RET-CODE             PIC X(2).
003400
003500 01  SHIFT-QTY-FLD.
003600     05  S-Q-BYTE OCCURS 8 TIMES PIC X.
003700
003800 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING RET-CODE, SHIFT-QTY-FLD.
003900
004000 6-MAIN.
004100 61-RIGHT-SHIFT.
004200     MOVE +8 TO SUB2, SUB3.
004300     IF S-Q-BYTE (SUB2) NOT = SPACES
004400         GO TO 611-R-S-SET-FLD.
004500 62-R-S-FIRST.
004600     IF S-Q-BYTE (SUB2) NOT = SPACES
004700         GO TO 63-R-S-MOVE.
004800     IF SUB2 = 1
004900         GO TO 611-R-S-SET-FLD.
005000     SUBTRACT 1 FROM SUB2.
005100     GO TO 62-R-S-FIRST.
005200 63-R-S-MOVE.
005300     IF S-Q-BYTE (SUB2) = SPACES
005400         GO TO 611-R-S-SET-FLD.
005500     MOVE S-Q-BYTE (SUB2) TO S-Q-BYTE (SUB3).
005600     MOVE SPACE TO S-Q-BYTE (SUB2).
005700     IF SUB2 = 1
005800         GO TO 611-R-S-SET-FLD.
005900     SUBTRACT 1 FROM SUB2, SUB3.
006000     GO TO 63-R-S-MOVE.
006100 611-R-S-SET-FLD.
006200     INSPECT SHIFT-QTY-FLD REPLACING LEADING " " BY "0".
006300
006400 6-MAIN-X.
006500     EXIT PROGRAM.
